@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
participant "Student / Browser" as Browser
participant "Angular client" as Angular
participant "ASP.NET Core gateway" as DotNet
participant "Python agent service" as Python
participant "Agent SDK runtime" as Sdk
participant "Claude API" as Claude
Browser -> Angular : 1. Run prompt
Angular -> DotNet : 2. POST to .NET gateway
DotNet -> DotNet : 3. Validate public request
DotNet -> Python : 4. Authenticate private handoff
Python -> Sdk : 5. Start real SDK runtime
Sdk -> Claude : 6. Exchange messages with Claude
loop streamed SDK messages
Sdk -> Python : 7. Project safe SDK message
Python -> DotNet : 8. Emit Python SSE response
DotNet -> Angular : 9. Flush chunks through .NET
end
alt complete
Sdk -> Python : 10. Normalize final result
Angular -> Angular : 11. Require result and done
Angular -> Browser : 12. Render safe colored Markdown
Python -> DotNet : 13. Complete result plus done
else failure
Python -> Angular : 14. Send safe stream failure
Angular -> Browser : 15. Show recoverable error
else missing key or invalid input
Python -> Angular : 16. Reject missing model key
end
@enduml
